かもしれない）","ts":"1635911349.027000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D9AAL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c336c176-8a8f-43ec-8c08-f03afc7b2a8d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁそれならせめて例外吐いて落とせって感じですね","ts":"1635911178.026400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JOkh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a1966af-eca4-4000-b5d0-d1a78ac2c7a6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どうせほとんどのユーザはgit配下でやるから大丈夫でしょくらいの気持ちで最初実装して放置してる可能性がある","ts":"1635911090.026100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ObV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2079c3e9-c9a7-4467-8643-4f21e1cba184","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u0026gt;  これクソ雑にやってるかもしれない、git project内じゃないと死ぬかも\n確かに、github project外のファイルで実行してましたね……","ts":"1635911021.025500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yFdR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73c17e8f-126d-4089-bdc0-abce027da199","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これクソ雑にやってるかもしれない、git project内じゃないと死ぬかも","ts":"1635910946.025000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tggdh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8db53f38-0ff7-410b-ac1a-b1c0b2c5b28c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー","ts":"1635910929.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sc3xf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"178634ed-9a63-4d9e-943c-094591908a24","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"9割方自分の環境依存という気はするので、とりあえずはFromResourcesを使って回避することにします。","ts":"1635910926.024500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZDw7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51452d22-466b-4db0-878b-080e6ca35862","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"alternate bufferの取得の有無とか、内部的に微妙に違うではあります","ts":"1635910887.023700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nSz8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0300340c-6596-48ce-b532-47c11538667a","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"`CocCommand fzf-preview Buffers` を使わずに、FromResources buffer使うワークアラウンドで回避可能ではあるけれど、なんだろうなぁ。","ts":"1635910857.023100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oDwc/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4201a8a4-e9d9-4075-9324-535f52e527b0","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"そもそも、 `CocCommand fzf-preview.FromResources buffer` は問題ないのに、Buffersだけおかしいというのが腑に落ちない。","ts":"1635910799.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Qk0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99652770-be0c-48c3-bb22-10ba341540a3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"term_startがいなかったので","ts":"1635910757.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tiZu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81621fb6-e029-426a-8ff5-8e52c4ebbe57","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一応取り方違うではあるんだけど、そんな変なことやってたかな","ts":"1635910749.021200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JOmG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"574cc9d2-b5f2-496f-9438-5c7303d289c5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"wilderではなさそうな気がする、maybe","ts":"1635910746.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"brz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51b031f7-368a-45e4-a4ce-59df7e967ac7","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"最小環境にしてみないとはっきりしなさそう。","ts":"1635910742.020700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9jX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecf0f005-f289-44ab-8f2f-4418095e6980","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"Buffersだけなんですよね……","ts":"1635910725.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bf5G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc0267ca-bb0b-4854-bbee-d9e6710e622f","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"Buffersを実行しなければ、\n`CocCommand fzf-preview.FromResources buffer mru` など他のコマンドは、問題なく動くところが謎。","ts":"1635910704.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ddKI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5da95680-ae0e-4a55-a3bc-0dc125dbcaf2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"手元で再現できないと大変かも","ts":"1635910647.018900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wc="}]},{"client_msg_id":"71c77f72-31e6-4f4b-bea3-183d3e0d6a28","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"wilderは使ってましたっけ？","ts":"1635910628.018700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qXC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc7e91e0-9078-419a-8de0-fa9455a952f9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimでは排他制御がかかるので死ぬ","ts":"1635910610.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W7rKb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2e8928f-2503-41aa-bbff-a69722612a70","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何か他にpopup terminal使うプラグインが入ってる？","ts":"1635910599.017800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iNrJH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1157a2a9-8ae5-4df0-8c71-300f7c368c07","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"`CocCommand fzf-preview Buffers` をgvimから実行しようとすると、1〜2秒固まってから、絞込ウインドウが表示されずに操作できるようになる→数十秒〜1分後ランダムに\n`Vim(call):E861: Cannot open a second popup with a terminal Error`\nが発生し、CommandPalette など他のコマンドが一切使えなくなる。\nneovimでは発生せずvimでのみ発生する、見たことない現象だけれど、プラグインとの衝突かな……","ts":"1635910563.017000","files":[{"id":"F02KZQ0M8HZ","created":